      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1ftm34p'
    '|a||It bends cautiously at low wealth, turns upward in the middle, and flattens again near the top.':
