      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:2giule'
    '|b||They read the upward stretch as a jump between classes: money that would change your whole way of life, not just add to it.':
