      ms: 6120
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1d0ntfj'
    '|a||The bulge sits at the same wealth for everyone. Then only people in the middle would gamble, and the very rich would never take a risk.':
