      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:3sx3lh'
    '|b||Yet the rich gamble too. His fix: put the bulge wherever each person already stands, so what counts is gains and losses from there.':
